@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### Health do gateway
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Listar usuários (via gateway → users-service)
GET {{gatewayUrl}}/users

### Criar usuário (via gateway)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carlos@example.com",
  "name": "Carlos User",
  "password": "senha12345"
}

### orders-service é events-only (sem rota no gateway)
# Ver logs do consumer em apps/orders-service
